\"594\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90064258-118a-4d52-b5e2-2710ca7f2746\" />\n\nLink to the mouse on Logitech's website: https://www.logitechg.com/en-us/shop/p/g502-hero-gaming-mouse.910-005469\n\nInformation on the USB connection to said mouse\n<img width=\"840\" height=\"118\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbd7c228-05b2-461f-bbe6-79c3a3e08cf3\" />\n\nI hope that something here is helpful. Thanks for taking the time to quiz me about this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6265460544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]